From 1e96c0bec8ae79eb86e6a5bd10a94799252d875e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:49:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: the Wallguard and Encrypted DNS tabs under Warden

Wallguard: the switch, lists (presets and up to 8 of your own), My rules,
Unbreak, profiles with blocked services, schedules and safe search, Why?, Pause,
the counters and the live view. Encrypted DNS: the server switch, the
certificate card, per-platform setup (Android, the Apple profile, Linux), the
"Block encrypted DNS that goes around the router" switch with its counters and
its one caution in amber. Both run as one closure with event listeners.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
